{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"systemic elegance systemic elegance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md","fileName":"Systemic Elegance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Systemic Elegance","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Emergent Systems]] [[Game Mechanics and Rules]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Emergent Systems","Game Mechanics and Rules","Systemic Depth","Cognitive Load","Play Space","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"systemic elegance systemic elegance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md","fileName":"Systemic Elegance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Systemic Elegance","heading":"Systemic Elegance","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Systemic elegance is the creation of rich, persistent behavior from a small set of consistent rules and few exceptions. It combines a simple high-level structure with [[Systemic Depth]] and recurring patterns across levels.\n\nConsistency reduces [[Cognitive Load]] and helps a player transfer learning between subsystems. An elegant system is therefore approachable while still producing a broad [[Play Space]] that remains difficult to exhaust or master.\n\nElegance also depends on a concise interactive vocabulary. Underdeveloped verbs and objects occupy the player's attention without adding comparable depth, while a smaller set of robust elements can support discovery through many relationships.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Emergent Systems","Game Mechanics and Rules","Systemic Depth","Cognitive Load","Play Space","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"systemic elegance systemic elegance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Systemic Elegance.md","fileName":"Systemic Elegance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Systemic Elegance","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[advancedgamedesign.pdf]]\n[[agamedesignvocabulary.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Emergent Systems","Game Mechanics and Rules","Systemic Depth","Cognitive Load","Play Space","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}